    "title": "refactor: rename ambiguous variable names",
    "body": "# closes #208 \r\n\r\nRename single-letter and ambiguous variables across the processing loop for better readability.\r\n\r\n**Changes:**\r\n- `main.rs`: `msg` -> `raw_diagnostic`, `code` -> `code_info`, `child_msg` -> `child_message`, `child_item` -> `child_entry`, `Err(e)` -> `Err(err)`\r\n- `config.rs`: `f` -> `file` in test helper\r\n- Fix pre-existing compile errors (undefined `diagnostic`, `span_obj`, `msg_text`, missing `rules` field, wrong types)\r\n- Fix `BudgetConfig` to `Config` type",
